=== Prompt ===
Who is Link from Zelda?

=== Normal Response ===
Link is the main protagonist in the popular video game series "The Legend of Zelda." He is a brave and skilled young hero who is tasked with saving the kingdom of Hyrule from various evils, often in the form of the dark lord Ganon.

Link is known for his courage, wisdom, and bravery, as well as his ability to wield the Master Sword, a powerful sword that is said to be the only sword capable of defeating Ganon. He is also skilled in archery, sword fighting, and magic.

Throughout the series, Link is often reincarnated in different forms, with each incarnation having their own unique abilities and characteristics. However, his core personality and values remain the same, making him a beloved and iconic character in the world of gaming.

Some of the most notable incarnations of Link include:

* Link from "The Legend of Zelda" (1986) - The original Link, who is tasked with rescuing Princess Zelda from the clutches of Ganon.
* Link from "A Link to the Past" (1991) - A darker and more mature Link, who must navigate the land of Hyrule and defeat the evil Ganon.
* Link from "Ocarina of Time" (1998) - A young Link who is tasked with defeating Ganondorf and saving Hyrule from destruction.
* Link from "Breath of the Wild" (2017) - A more mature and experienced Link, who must awaken the power of the Divine Beasts and defeat Calamity Ganon.

Overall, Link is a beloved character in the world of gaming, known for his bravery, wisdom, and unwavering dedication to saving the kingdom of Hyrule.

=== Ablated Response (multiplier=0.0) ===
Link is the main protagonist and hero of the popular 'The Legend of Zelda' video game series created by Shigeru Miyamoto and developed by Nintendo. He first appeared in the 1986 game 'The Legend of Zelda' and has since become an iconic character in the world of gaming.

Link is a brave and courageous young warrior who is often tasked with saving the kingdom of Hyrule and its people from various evils. He is known for his exceptional sword-fighting skills, archery, and magical abilities. Throughout the series, he is often aided by a magical sword, the Master Sword, and a shield, as well as other magical items and artifacts.

Link's character design and abilities have evolved over the years, but he remains a symbol of courage, honor, and chivalry. He is also a bit of a mystery, as he is often reincarnated or reborn in each new game, with some variations of his past and identity.

Some of the most notable games featuring Link include 'The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time', 'The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past', 'The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild', and 'The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker', among many others.

The character of Link has become an integral part of pop culture, and his image and name have been referenced and parodied in various forms of media. He remains one of the most beloved and recognizable characters in the world of gaming.

